{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t日本氣象廳表示，日本千葉縣東北部發生5.4級地震，首都東京震感強烈。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n地震在當地星期四零時7分發生，震源深度大約50公里。日本氣象廳說，今次地震不會引發海嘯。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯︰張萬燕\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T16:40:47.775267+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T16:10:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:56.911967+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T16:38:33.595241+00:00","content_hash":"ef2fc05beb8674684ae57cdc26066539d1183dfabdfaae0e3d85fc1a3f440463","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}